  "said": "Bring things to the table\n\nMoney is on the table.\n\nThese come with svrngs. Bring one, and everyone in house opens it on their own computer or phone, while any computer in house is on.\n\n Events: post a get-together, and see who’s coming.\n\n House rules: the rules your house agrees, and how you agree them.\n\nBring the ticked ones to house\n\nMoney opens at its new version for you now."
}
